[lint:error] $TEMP/invalid_choice_ampersand.bpmn bpmn
Source: $TEMP/invalid_choice_ampersand.bpmn
Issues: 1

[bpmn.invalid_xml] Error: BPMN XML is not well-formed
    ,-[ $TEMP/invalid_choice_ampersand.bpmn:14:59 ]
 14 |            <qianji:choice value="confirm" label="Confirm & Submit">All information is correct</qianji:choice>
    |                                                          `- escape raw ampersand as `&amp;`
    |Help: Replace this literal `&` with `&amp;`. Preserve BPMN ids and qianji metadata.
    |Contract: qianji.bpmn.xml.well_formed.v1 requires literal ampersands in XML text or attributes to be escaped as &amp;.

Proposed patch:
```diff
--- $TEMP/invalid_choice_ampersand.bpmn
+++ $TEMP/invalid_choice_ampersand.bpmn
@@ -14,1 +14,1 @@
-            <qianji:choice value="confirm" label="Confirm & Submit">All information is correct</qianji:choice>
+            <qianji:choice value="confirm" label="Confirm &amp; Submit">All information is correct</qianji:choice>
```

Return unified diff only.
